OL,3,W"###"###"###T//-,.,,-,.-/.-//,,.,.,.-//
OL,4,CWoman, 62, 'died while saving          
OL,5,Cgrandson's life'                       
OL,6,GA family have paid tribute to a        
OL,7,Ggrandmother who they say died while    
OL,8,Gsaving the life of her grandson,       
OL,9,Gdescribing her as a "hero".            
OL,11,FBarbara Barganska, 62, lost her life   
OL,12,Fwhen she was struck by an HGV while on 
OL,13,Ffoot at traffic lights in Stallard     
OL,14,FStreet in Trowbridge, Wiltshire at     
OL,15,F10:00 BST on 23 November.              
OL,17,FShe was with her two-year-old grandson 
OL,18,Fat the time of the crash it is         
OL,19,Fbelieved the reason he did not suffer  
OL,20,Fany serious injuries is because she    
OL,21,Fpushed his buggy out of the way.       
OL,22,                                   G1/4 
