OL,3,W"###"###"###T//-,.,,-,.-/.-//,,.,.,.-//
OL,4,CMel Giedroyc reunited with jacket from 
OL,5,Cuni days                               
OL,6,GNearly 40 years after it disappeared,  
OL,7,Gcomedian and presenter Mel Giedroyc    
OL,8,Ghas been reunited with a leather       
OL,9,Gjacket she wore "every single day at   
OL,10,Guniversity" after it appeared at a     
OL,11,Gcharity shop.                          
OL,13,FZoey Kennedy, manager at Oxfam in      
OL,14,FStroud, said she was straightening out 
OL,15,Fthe tartan lining of the jacket when   
OL,16,Fshe became "very excited".             
OL,18,F"On the name tag was Melanie Giedroyc  
OL,19,Fand I thought, could that be?" Kennedy 
OL,20,Fsaid.                                  
OL,22,                                   G2/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
