OL,3,W"###"###"###T//-,.,,-,.-/.-//,,.,.,.-//
OL,4,C'Extremist' jailed for raping woman in 
OL,5,Cher home                               
OL,6,GAn alleged terrorist has been jailed   
OL,7,Gfor six years for raping a woman whose 
OL,8,Gmobile phone recording provided key    
OL,9,Gevidence in the trial.                 
OL,11,FAyman Al-Shammari, 28, a refugee from  
OL,12,FKuwait living in Taunton, Somerset,    
OL,13,Fwas sentenced to six years on Friday   
OL,14,Fat Bristol Crown Court after being     
OL,15,Ffound guilty of rape in October.       
OL,17,FThe jury heard that Al-Shammari had    
OL,18,Fconsensual sex with a woman in her     
OL,19,F20s, but when she told him to stop, he 
OL,20,Fcontinued. Austria has now requested   
OL,21,Fthe extradition of Al-Shammari on      
OL,22,Fterrorism charges.                G4/4 
